# Third-party sources wine.app is built from beside Wine, FEX and DXMT (ship-base spec §5, §7), sourced by
# wine-arm64/build.sh and export.sh. In the build stamp, not in the Wine, FEX or DXMT patch series: editing this file
# never re-clones Wine or FEX.
# The tarballs, checked by SHA-256 (the values match Homebrew's API cache and a fetch from these hosts, 2026-10-04):
# FreeType (libfreetype.6.dylib) and gnutls, with nettle and gmp linked into it (libgnutls.30.dylib).
FREETYPE_URL=https://download.savannah.gnu.org/releases/freetype/freetype-2.14.3.tar.xz
FREETYPE_SHA256=36bc4f1cc413335368ee656c42afca65c5a3987e8768cc28cf11ba775e785a5f
GNUTLS_URL=https://www.gnupg.org/ftp/gcrypt/gnutls/v3.8/gnutls-3.8.13.tar.xz
GNUTLS_SHA256=ffed8ec1bf09c2426d4f14aae377de4753b53e537d685e604e99a8b16ca9c97e
NETTLE_URL=https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/nettle/nettle-4.0.tar.gz
NETTLE_SHA256=3addbc00da01846b232fb3bc453538ea5468da43033f21bb345cb1e9073f5094
GMP_URL=https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/gmp/gmp-6.3.0.tar.xz
GMP_SHA256=a3c2b80201b89e68616f4ad30bc66aee4927c3ce50e33929ca819d5c43538898
# FFmpeg (libavutil.60, libavcodec.62, libavformat.62, libswscale.9 and libswresample.6 .dylib; video playback spec §6).
# FFmpeg publishes no checksum: this SHA-256 is of the tarball whose .asc verified against FFmpeg's release signing key
# (FCF9 86EA 15E6 E293 A564 4F10 B432 2F04 D676 58D8), 2026-10-08, and matches Homebrew's ffmpeg@8.
FFMPEG_URL=https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-8.1.3.tar.xz
FFMPEG_SHA256=7138d28c96d9d3e3af4ee3d8cad72741f8ffb40da90c1112235dea3ecd3178a3
# lsteamclient, the Steam bridge (spec §7): Proton's lsteamclient/ folder at this commit, a sparse, blob-filtered
# checkout without the Steamworks SDK folders, with wine-arm64/patches/lsteamclient on top. Its series is these
# LSTEAMCLIENT_ lines and those patches: a tarball pin never re-fetches it.
LSTEAMCLIENT_REPO=https://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton.git
LSTEAMCLIENT_COMMIT=bc896217ffcd67f892f952b010f898fe7bd0f0a1
